  "title": "Envela to Announce Second Quarter 2026 Financial Results on Wednesday, August 5, 2026",
  "summary": "IRVING, TX / ACCESS Newswire / July 28, 2026 / Envela Corporation (“Envela” or the “Company”) announced today that it plans to report its financial results for the second quarter of 2026 after the market close on Wednesday, August 5, 2026. Envela periodically provides information for investors on its corporate website, envela.com. This includes press […]",
